480:        accountedRewards = accountedRewards + reward;
481:        pool.accRewardPerShare = pool.accRewardPerShare + newAccRewardPerShare;
482:        pool.lastRewardTime = timestamp;
```
**As we can see that `accountedRewards` will increase after each reward update(L480)**. 
`availableRewards()` will be used as `rawReward` whenever `availableRewards()` is less than `rawReward`:
```solidity
    function _newRewards(
        VaultInfo memory pool,
        uint256 _totalAllocPoint
    ) internal view returns (uint256 newReward, uint256 newAccRewardPerShare) {
