The flash lender calls the onCreditFlashLoan function. After repaying the debt, the function approves the flash lender to pay the flash loan. However, the function only approves an amount equal to the flash loan amount, while there is also a fee to pay. As we can see in the creditFlashLoan function, the intention is to transfer the flash loan amount plus the fee.

